\end{equation}
for $q\in\overline X$ near $p$, where $A\in\mathbb R$, $c_{n,\gamma}>0$ and $d_{\overline g}(\cdot,\cdot)$ is the distance function. Furthermore, $A\geq 0$ with equality holding if and only if $(\overline X,\overline g)$ is conformally diffeomorphic to the standard unit ball in $\mathbb R^{n+1}$.

