\label{conj.ass}
   Let $I=I(G)$ be the edge ideal of a graph $G$ in a polynomial ring $R$ over a field. Let $f_1,\ldots,f_q$ be separated stars on $I$. Then \begin{eqnarray*}
    P\in \Ass(R/(I,f_1,\ldots,f_q))  \text{ if and only if } P=(Q,f_1,\ldots,f_q),
\end{eqnarray*}
for some  $Q\in \Ass(R/I)=\Min(R/I)$.

