\label{conj:equi}
	Let $H$ be a balanced height and $W \subseteq \prod_v BG[k_v]$ be a continuity set.
	Then there exists a thin subset $\Omega \subset BG[k]$ such that
	$$\lim_{B \to \infty}\frac{\#\{ \varphi \in BG[k] \setminus \Omega : \varphi \in W, H(\varphi) \leq B\}}
	{\#\{ \varphi \in BG[k] \setminus \Omega : H(\varphi) \leq B\}} = 
