	on $\re > a(H).$

\label{conj:Peyre}
	Let $\mathcal{D} \subset \R^{\mathcal{C}_G^*/\Gamma_k}$ be a compact continuity set and $u \in  \R_{> 0}^{\mathcal{C}_G^*/\Gamma_k}$. For a real number $B > 1$ let $\mathcal{D}_B := \mathcal{D} + \log(B) \cdot u$. As $B \to \infty$ we have
