		\item The property ``$T$ is $\NTP_2$'' can be detected from $f_{T}(\kappa, \lambda)$ (note that if $T$ is $\TP_2$, then $f_{T}(\kappa, \lambda)$ is maximal, i.e.~equal to $\lambda^{\kappa}$ for all $\aleph_0 \leq \kappa \leq  \lambda$).
