 ${\rm Sh}_{K_1}(\RG, \RX)_E$, i.e. an $O_E$-scheme $\CS_{K_1, S}$ together with an isomorphism $\CS_{K_1, S}\otimes_{O_E}E\simeq {\rm Sh}_{K_1}(\RG, \RX)_E$,   which has the following properties:

