Let $\tbeta,$ $\ttt$, $\alpha,$ $A$ be defined as in Theorem \ref{thm: High density beta small probability} and let $\widetilde{{Q}}_{\tbeta < \ttt}^{High}$ be defined as in Definition \ref{def: High density beta small asymptotic}.
    We expect the following identities of functions:
    \begin{equation}
