    \end{equation}
    where $\widetilde{F}_{-\tbeta, -\ttt}^{HD}$ is defined in \cite[Theorem 1.6 (1.13)]{zeng2025stationary}.

Let $\tbeta,$ $\ttt$, $\alpha,$ $A$ be defined as in Theorem \ref{thm: High density beta large probability} and let $\widetilde{{Q}}_{\tbeta > \ttt}^{High}$ be defined as in Definition \ref{def: High density beta large asymptotic}. We expect the following identities of functions:
