Let $\tbeta,$ $\ttt$, $\alpha,$ $A$ be defined as in Theorem \ref{thm: One param probability} and let $\widetilde{{Q}}_{\ttt}^{Low}$ be defined as in Definition \ref{def: One param asymptotic}. We expect the following identities of functions:
